>              a^16 / (c * d), b^8 / (d * c^4) ];
<fp group on the generators [ a, b, c, d ]>
gap> procId3 := PqStart( G4 );
3
gap> K := Pq( procId3 : Prime := 2, ClassBound := 1 );
